{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"865604031854411826","content":"\"About your experience with relationships and your feelings about me. And with how you acted the other night between Eliza and I... It wasn't okay. To pull us together when we were enjoying something between just the two of us. To put it at risk for what? To try and see if you cared for me more or if you would look to Eliza first? Putting yourself under the influence?\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T20:16:45.012000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868587531191586857","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"865604031854411826","content":"\"You're not cursed to be forever alone Willow. You can do and be whatever you want. I want you to be your own person and not feel pulled back for me.\nI saw how you acted after my passing... Considering grabbing drachma yourself with it\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T20:17:43.054000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868587774637396028","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
