{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"865604031854411826","content":"He strains his breath and rolls back in the hammock while he listens for your response","created_at":"2021-07-24T20:18:16.575000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868587915234656336","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"865604031854411826","content":"\"I'm not sure why I acted how I did, but I am in better touch with myself. I know I want to be with you, Finn. I have another reason to go on, now that the ravens are gone.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T20:25:16.577000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868589676850733076","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"865604031854411826","content":"\"I think... I think we should end this for now. Our relationship shouldn't be built on your risk and fear of losing me. I'd rather you see me as a friend first than just your love interest. If we have that primarily, then I would be willing to try again, but I want us to be living with hope in our hearts unclouded by fear.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T20:29:07.069000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868590643604250665","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"865604031854411826","content":"\"You have a good heart and have some emotions that I think you need to consider when it isn't just whether I'm alive or not. And how you feel about Eliza and me. For me, I only can only do something serious if it were exclusive, polyamory is not for me\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T20:31:46.177000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868591310951575593","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"865604031854411826","content":"\"I'm sorry\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T20:31:50.336000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868591328395681812","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"865604031854411826","content":"\"I have no feelings for Eliza.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T20:32:07.229000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868591399250051092","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"865604031854411826","content":"\"If that were true, I'm not sure why you would have sat us down and had the potion\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T20:33:53.795000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868591846220234812","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"865604031854411826","content":"\"It was just a moment of confusion.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T20:34:07.879000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868591905292816454","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"865604031854411826","content":"\"I was overwhelmed by seeing my mother, and I lost control.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T20:38:08.762000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868592915629371403","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"865604031854411826","content":"\"And seeing you die... I knew you'd be back... noone can keep Finn Midask down, not even death itself.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T20:39:20.523000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868593216616812654","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"865604031854411826","content":"\"I don't just see you as a love interest, either. You're one of the first friends I made when I came to the city. I'll always consider you one of those.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T20:40:30.273000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868593509169528943","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"865604031854411826","content":"\"I don't know what my mother told you, but I'm not afriad of being alone anymore. I'm a different person than I was when I ran from home.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T20:41:33.695000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868593775180656690","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
